        {
            "id": "ann_1",
            "type": "note",
            "text": "Callback DAT \u2014 Event-Driven Scripts\n\nConnect any node to input 0 to observe it.\nCallbacks fire on events:\n  on_start  \u2014 runs once on first cook\n  on_cook   \u2014 runs each time target cooks\n  on_value_change \u2014 when a param changes\n  on_create \u2014 when the DAT itself is created\n\nContext variables: target, event, event_param",
